  "title": "PDD Holdings to Report Second Quarter 2026 Unaudited Financial Results on August 24, 2026",
  "summary": "DUBLIN and SHANGHAI, Aug. 17, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PDD Holdings Inc. (“PDD Holdings” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: PDD) today announced that it will report its unaudited financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, before U.S. markets open on Monday, August 24, 2026.",
